<title>POLAND: STOMIL NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 8.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>STOMIL NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 8.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.21 vs  11.64</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	10.58 vs  12.33</p>
<p> Operating profit    10.25 vs  11.26</p>
<p> Sales		   64.04 vs  55.43</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    54.32 vs  73.80</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	80.09 vs  89.31</p>
<p> Operating profit    73.67 vs  86.34</p>
<p> Sales		  643.62 vs 497.01</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyremaker is Stomil Olsztyn SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
